{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく空いてしまってすみません(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで沢山の人が\n頭痛の正体や原因を教えてくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"閃輝暗点っていうんやね...！\nありがとう（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わりと同じ症状の人いて吃驚した！\n同士ですね。\nあれは辛いよなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会は最近ないですが、\nイベント等で来てくださる方は\nお会いしてますね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方の笑顔には本当に\n救われるなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会もありがたいことに\n完売しました（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の人に支えてもらってる幸せ、\n噛み締めて過ごします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日のイベントの写真＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギガ〜！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/03/26/0200134/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/03/26/0200134/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/03/26/0200134/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹はお肉が恥ずかしいので、\nシークレット♡もう少ししたら痩せます♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帽子はCMの時と\nかぶり方を変えてみたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりん、卒業おめでとう＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/03/26/0200134/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダラ行かせていただきました！\n涙も鼻水も吹き出ました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く、いいステージだったなあ。\nいいもの見せていただいた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりんの歌声、好きだ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、名古屋に来ています。\n仕事先で沢山の人が、永島さんは\n本当にいい子だったよねと皆さん口を\n揃えておっしゃっていました(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな方でしたか？と聞かれ、私は\n改めてせいらりんの事を思い返しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ直ぐで、真面目で、明るくて、\n話しやすい。そして愛くるしくて\n優しい...本当に素敵な人だったなぁと、\n熱弁してしまいました(^_^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりん、仲間から友達へ。\n一緒に過ごし、\n苦楽を共にしたこの4年半の日々のことは\nずっと忘れません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までありがとう！！！\n照れ臭いけど本当にけっこう好きです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また会おうね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/03/26/0200134/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真は今日の\n名古屋キャンペーンにて。\n初めての名古屋城だよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタイルプラスさんという番組で！\n明日OA☆ぜひ見てください♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTBさんの写真貼りたかったけど\n枚数の制限を超えてしまった(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回貼ります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛発売中☆\n素敵に撮っていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナチュラルセクシー&クールかな！？笑\n自分でいうのも何だけど(￣▽￣)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ皆さん、\nチェックしてみてください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週はソニレコ生放送もあるよ〜！\nそちらもぜひ（；＿；）！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お休みなさーい！\nお身体に気をつけてよ！！！"}],"source":"archive"}